              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "QuaintDuck3053"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I sauteed 4 garlic cloves (I love garlic) in 1 tablespoon of butter and 2 teaspoons of olive oil. Once garlic was fragrant I added spinach and cooked for 6 minutes, added fresh parm, tossed. It came out perfectly. Will definitely try this again.",
