              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "QuirkyPoke9368"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I replaced garlic salt with garlic powder because i dont like salt and added chilli seasoning. I also added the cheese halfway rather then at the end so it would get crispy (turned out as intended!) Cooked it for slightly less time than in the recipe because i was hungry. Ate with scrambled eggs. Best breakfast ever! 5 stars because i am a cooking amateur and physically incapable of judging if there is room for improvement. Photo looks rank but trust me it looked great in real life.",
            "datePublished": "2023-12-03T10:49:52.319Z"
