              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "clubby981"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It is not that much more work to use fresh sliced garlic, so that's what I did. I used three cloves and let it cook in the oil before adding the spinach. When the garlic pieces started to sizzle, I added the spinach leaves and salt.",
