            },
            "reviewBody": "I used 2tsp of olive oil and 1tsp of butter. Instead of garlic salt I used minced garlic, with a pinch of sea salt and pepper. Cooked for 5m. 10m is too long, I was weary it'll be mushy and brown. Sprinkled a little shredded parmesan just to taste.",
