              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "skeeties"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I thought this was great! I did sliced fresh garlic and a couple of pinches of kosher salt instead of garlic salt. I also used 18 oz. of spinach and added a bit of butter to the olive oil for the saute', as I knew it would cook way down. We will definitely make this again!",
            "datePublished": "2016-02-16T17:03:32.970Z"
          },
          {
